# DSH plugin runtime artifacts
python/ur_worker.log
# 日志限幅会把写满的日志滚成 ur_worker.log.1 —— `*.log` 不匹配带后缀的滚动档，必须单独盖住，
# 否则每个会话都会留一个 8 MB 的未跟踪文件（还有被 git add 误提交的风险）。
python/ur_worker.log.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log

# Node
node_modules/

# Release build artifacts
Release/

# editor / os
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# SDD / superpowers scratch
.superpowers/

# pnpm project-local content-addressable store (created by `pnpm add`)
.pnpm-store/

# pnpm must never run inside this workspace member: the outer repo is a Yarn
# workspace, and the topology gate (`verify-layout`) rejects a pnpm lock/workspace
# file on disk. Ignoring them here keeps an accidental `pnpm install` from being
# committed; the gate still fails loudly until they are removed.
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml

# DSH local project memory store (agent indexing scratch)
.dsh-project-memory/

# UR 官方手册 PDF（约 3.8 MB）仅供本机离线查阅，不作为仓库内容分发。
# 需要时按型号/版本从 UR 支持站点下载：https://www.universal-robots.com/download/
ScriptManual/

# 本机专属的解释器 shim（含本机用户名路径，且刻意不在 package.json 的 files 里）。
# 它只解决「这台机器的 python 找不到 numpy/paramiko」，见文件头部说明；
# 提交它会泄露本机路径，也会让别人的机器套用错误的 site-packages。
python/sitecustomize.py
